": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "270732882_84ywOmTXR", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "大宗商品是最容易有牛鞭效应的，反射弧特别长", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "17963-18044", "abstract": "牛鞭效应的基本思想是：当供应链上的各节点企业只根据来自其相邻的下级企业的需求信息进行生产或者供应决策时，需求信息的不真实性会沿着供应链逆流而上，产生逐级放大的现象", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "270732882_84ywOmTXR", "userVid": 270732882, "topics": [], "createTime": 1762768572, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 270732882, "name": "阮芷嫣", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEL1CEic7gRM4VcLyazcFuyWcSmPqnxqhTtRsSRRYCzEic0BlskDDA49IticNvpnw0hvExCmNnGPBTGzoPgdBntwC3AwyrcWffjntrMKCL8uXENLQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}}, "likesCount": 6}]}, {"range": "18133-18167", "bookMarkCount": 85, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 6, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "73391284_8bfPhHqUV", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "“用牛鞭效应可以解释为什么大宗商品的产能周期长于其他行业。牛鞭效应的基本思想是：当供应链上的各节点企业只根据来自其相邻的下级企业的需求信息进行生产或者供应决策时，需求信息的不真实性会沿着供应链逆流而上，产生逐级放大的现象。当信息到达最源头的供应商时，其所获得的需求信息和实际消费市场中的顾客需求信息发生了很大的偏差。由于这种需求放大效应的影响，供应方往往维持比需求方更高的库存水平或者生产准备计划。由于上游资源品处于供应链的最末端，其波动性最大，反应最慢，也最剧烈。”", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "18135-18137", "abstract": "上游", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 16, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "73391284_8bfPhHqUV", "userVid": 73391284, "topics": [], "createTime": 1786357593, "contextAbstract": "者生产准备计划。由于上游资源品处于供应链", "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 73391284, "name": "花开有时", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0006-Ga3w1QmayZbilJD6mOGc210/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "花开有时", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "如何看见自己，不抱歉", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}}}, {"reviewId": "3126459_81913kfTt", "review": {"abstract": "由于上游资源品处于供应链的最末端，其波动性最大，反应最慢，也最剧烈。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "产业链离消费终端越远的产品，价格周期性越明显", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "18133-18167", "createTime": 1750754627, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "3126459_81913kfTt", "userVid": 3126459, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 16, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 3126459, "name": "firstprinciple", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/XYrRG5UShDd1OS4NmWmYVvGiahSoB8vicj5rBuDzEmgHdlDvOsl7jtCScOZuryFyyUSv