期研究", "author": {"userVid": 411558284, "name": "墨染星辰", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-8Hx_xCU9xULKvKTMII~7Bf7/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "阅读", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "唯情怀可渡世间薄凉！", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240715-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}}, {"reviewId": "380402079_80QEKarHz", "review": {"abstract": "由于上游资源品处于供应链的最末端，其波动性最大，反应最慢，也最剧烈。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "因为上游资源品处于供应链的最上方，由最下方的需求方一级一级传导上去，时间长，信息偏差大，所以当传导到上方时，就会发生较大的价格动荡。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "18133-18167", "createTime": 1749711784, "title": "", "type": 1, "reviewId": "380402079_80QEKarHz", "userVid": 380402079, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 16, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 380402079, "name": "@雁菁💞", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-YP88sMnDO5fc6f~Xb7tXUf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "@雁菁💞", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "文字中谋心，阅读中谋趣，烟火中谋生。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "人丑就要多读书，腹有诗书气自华。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-500", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 500}}}, "likesCount": 2}]}, {"range": "18492-18504", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "342433969_855FfUa27", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "产能周期划分过后，用历史线位进行叠加，寻找当前所在位置，指导下一步的投资。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "根据上面对产能周期的划分", "range": "18492-18504", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "342433969_855FfUa27", "userVid": 342433969, "topics": [], "createTime": 1764650715, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 342433969, "name": "Qking", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/xWelk9WdlzQtnuRU0h2kTqs7StWhcJ3iaOJApvDMtcWBNia7fmULnEyYFr7stY1kLbSD8JdjvpXpsMLPhiajicNxCrSRKlNfGz37wtIwnOgbKRY/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M4-0-100", "desc": "阅读书籍", "title": "阅读书籍", "levelIndex": 100}}}}]}, {"range": "18645-18699", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 1, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "426066534_8chRPvbWs", "review": {"abstract": "已经到达了一个重要的低点附近，这个低点在上一轮产能周期中是1986年，随后无论是金属还是原油都出现了价格反弹", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "大致思路是经济经过两次冲击后资源通缩情况下的一次宿命与反抗。这几天读下来我觉得现在和周老师当时最大的区别是无限qe对经济的破坏，已经不能完全套用周老师的理论了。（就像上证指数失真），可以作为一个思路参考", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "18645-18699", "createTime": 1789995140, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "426066534_8chRPvbWs", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}}]}, {"range": "19488-19551", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 2, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_88562ZVVV", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "商品价格里同时藏着两种周期：\n1. 很长很长的趋势 2. 相对短一点的超级周期\n商品价格不是只涨只跌，里面还包含一个非常缓慢几十年不变的长期大趋势（Trend），比如通胀、技术进步、资源枯竭带来的缓慢价格抬升，这个是长期底色。然后把这个缓慢趋势去掉后剩下的就是围绕长期趋势上下波动、周期更长但比康波短、幅度非常猛的波动，这个15-25年左右的大波动叫作超级周期（Super Cycle），它和固定资产投资、中周期密切相关，比单纯的产能周期更明显、更贴合价格走势。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "超级周期", "range": "19546-19550", "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "254854030_88562ZVVV", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1775183304, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 7, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "426066534_89ygddkMd", "review": {"abstract": "除了大宗商品的产能周期，大宗商品价格一定与中周期或者固定资产投资趋势的更短周期相关，我们以国外论文的称呼方式，称其为超级周期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "chapterUid": 16, "content": "回过头来看，我没有理解超级周期和产能周期真正的区别点在哪", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "19488-19551", "createTime": 1780361437, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 16, "reviewId": "426066534_89ygddkMd", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "11 世界大宗商品周期研究", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": []}]}]}